{"id":"6018cc1b13710826","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-TB.md","title":"Tarski 双条件理论 TB","display":"df-TB — Tarski 双条件理论 TB","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-TB","aliases":["91-df-TB","91-df-typed-truth-base"],"display":"df-TB — Tarski 双条件理论 TB","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-TB"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-TB</span><span>91-df-typed-truth-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-TB — Tarski 双条件理论 TB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶演绎闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span> 为基础句的双条件模式，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 为完整扩展语言归纳，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>TB 是 Tarski-biconditionals 的缩写。按原书 Definition 7.1，TB 包含完整真理语言归纳；无扩展归纳的版本是原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tb}\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\mathrm{tb}\\upharpoonright\\)</span>，此处记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\)</span>。\n两者均对 PA 算术保守（Theorem 7.5）。类型限制落在双条件的矩阵语言，而非禁止在归纳中出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 7.1、7.3 与 Theorem 7.5，印刷页 53–56，PDF 页 64–67。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)$ 为基础句的双条件模式，见 [[91-df-T-schema]]。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}$ 为完整扩展语言归纳，见 [[91-df-induction-schema]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{TB}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tb}\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e2485d60abdf08e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}$ 已按原书包含完整 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}$，见 [[91-df-TB]]。"},{"id":"9b3d91c91ef33900","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f23e822ba5d24954","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29860e308d5c5265","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"30584c32b5f9ed53","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0dc766857d9e42f4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7f2540086a62d464","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],